{"id":"629f1fd3f5cdb7000b59cf43","slug":"chris-ofili-pink-afternoon-5","title":"Pink Afternoon","artists":["Chris Ofili"],"date":"2021","medium":"Etching on Suminagashi painting","dimensions":"40 × 28 in","image":"dB3BzckJ99AFTMbVzvxHOQ","c":["#dddbd4","#cfa09c","#785453"],"said":[{"k":"note","q":"Ofili’s Pink Afternoon series uses the Suminagashi Japanese paper marbling technique to create unique chine collé backgrounds for etchings based on Stéphane Mallarmé’s 1876 poem of the same title. The abstracted background Ofili creates with the Suminagashi paintings evoke the dreamlike state of the just awoken fawn as he attempts to reconcile whether the encounter with nymphs he recalls is a dream or reality.","by":"Two Palms, on Artsy"}],"events":[{"k":"made","y":"2021","q":"2021","o":1,"s":[0]},{"k":"listed","y":"2022-08-23","who":"Two Palms","n":"listed by the gallery","ll":[40.7211,-73.9996],"w":"New York, US","p":"new-york-us","pr":"office","o":3,"s":[0]},{"k":"exhibited","y":"2022-09-02","e":"2022-09-05","t":"Two Palms at Frieze Seoul 2022","v":"Two Palms","ll":[40.7211,-73.9996],"w":"New York, US","p":"new-york-us","pr":"office","o":2,"s":[0],"x":[0]}],"sources":[{"name":"Artsy","url":"https://www.artsy.net/artwork/chris-ofili-pink-afternoon-5"}],"threads":[{"id":"d3c306dd","k":"show","name":"Two Palms at Frieze Seoul 2022","at":"Two Palms, New York","y":2022,"ll":[40.7211,-73.9996],"n":1},{"id":"9d42e535","k":"artist","name":"Chris Ofili","y":2021,"n":5}],"asof":"2026-10-01"}